### 1. Costco - Cào theo danh mục (Category)
POST http://localhost:3001/claw-costco/crawl
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoryUrl": "https://www.costco.com/sun-care.html",
    "category": "sun-care"
}

###

### 2. Costco - Cào trực tiếp 1 sản phẩm chi tiết (PDP)
POST http://localhost:3001/claw-data/crawl
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "store": "costco",
    "source": "manual",
    "productUrl": "https://www.costco.com/p/-/qunol-plus-coq10-ubiquinol-200-mg-with-omega-3-90-softgels/100301666?sp=grs&langId=-1"
}

###

### 3. Walmart - Cào theo danh mục (Category) thông qua OpenClaw
POST http://localhost:3001/claw-data/crawl
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "store": "walmart",
    "source": "manual",
    "categoryUrl": "https://www.walmart.com/browse/beauty/sun-care/1085666_1001550_1001551",
    "category": "sun-care"
}

###

### 4. Kiểm tra trạng thái cào (Status) của Costco
GET http://localhost:3001/claw-costco/status

###

### 5. Lấy danh sách sản phẩm cào được gần nhất từ Costco
GET http://localhost:3001/claw-costco/products?limit=5
